# AI agent session state, memory and scratch. These hold the local session
# records, long-term memory notes for the agents working this workspace, and
# throwaway probe scripts. They are working state, not project assets, and the
# repo has a public mirror -- so they must never be committed. Ignoring them
# does NOT delete anything: the files stay on disk untouched.
.zcode/
.trae/
.workbuddy/

# Authoring scratch space. Empty placeholder tree today; the loaders and the
# authoring tools write session/draft/compiled state into it at runtime.
AWAKE/workspace/

# Python bytecode caches left behind by the tooling scripts.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
